<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University! &nbsp;You can schedule an appointment to discuss your ASU transfer options at &nbsp;Rio Salado Community College every Tuesday from 8:30 a.m. – 4:30 p.m. You can follow the directions below to schedule an appointment online.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ol><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Go to <a href="https://transfer.asu.edu/maricopa">transfer.asu.edu/maricopa</a>.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Click&nbsp;<b>Make an Appointment</b>&nbsp;on the right-hand side of the page,&nbsp;choose Rio Salado Community College as your school and click <b>Go</b>.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Available appointment times will appear on the calendar (Tuesdays only). For future weeks, click <b>Next</b> at the top of the calendar.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Click <b>Make an Appointment</b> on the date and time that works best for you. Submit the contact form that appears. After submitting your contact information, be sure to confirm your time to make the appointment.</span></li></ol></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">The ASU office at Rio Salado Community College is at the Tempe Administrative Headquarters location, (3rd floor advising office of the tower), 2323 W. 14th Street, Tempe, AZ 85281.&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Want another option to see what it’s like to be a Sun Devil? We’d love to speak to you on one of Arizona State University’s four campus locations to discuss your transfer options. Appointments are held Fridays from 8:30 a.m. to 4 p.m. Please follow the directions below to schedule an appointment online.</div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><ol><li>Go to&nbsp;<a href="http://transfer.asu.edu/friday/week">transfer.asu.edu/friday/week</a>.</li><li>Available appointment times will appear on the calendar (Fridays only). For future dates, use the drop-down option under&nbsp;<b>View appointments by week</b>, then click&nbsp;<b>Go</b>.</li><li>Click&nbsp;<b>Make an appointment</b>&nbsp;on the date and time that works best for you (the ASU office location will be listed before you schedule an appointment). Submit the contact form that appears. After submitting your contact information, be sure to confirm your time to make the appointment.</li></ol></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">A confirmation email with the location will be emailed to you. While you’re on campus, we also hope you find your fit by&nbsp;<a href="http://visit.asu.edu/">scheduling a campus tour</a>.</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Admission Services</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}<br><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>